      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The power system is down. Restore the circuits to advance to the next
        floor.


        <b>WASD</b>: Move  |  <b>Mouse Left</b>: Attack  |  <b>Space</b>:
        Roll


        <b><color=#FFD700>Player 1:</color></b> Press <b>[F]</b> to
        use the flashlight and reveal hidden circuits.

        <b><color=#FFA500>Player
        2:</color></b> Press <b>[E]</b> to repair the circuits and defeat the <b>Skeletons</b>.


        <i>Work
        closely together. Light is your only chance of survival!</i>'
